<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Phuket Guide: 12 places – Big Buddha, old town, Phi Phi, markets &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Big Buddha</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning or late afternoon and cover shoulders and knees. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>98.31281,7.82774,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Old town &amp; Chinese shrine</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>98.38877,7.88539,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Wat Chalong</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Combine the visit with the Big Buddha. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>98.33747,7.84626,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Phuket Old Town – Thalang Road &amp; Soi Romanee</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come on Sundays for the market. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>98.38922,7.88478,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Promthep Cape &amp; sunset</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come an hour before sunset. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>98.3054,7.76432,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Karon, Kata &amp; southern beaches</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Watch the flags and the current. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>98.29805,7.81936,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Phang Nga Bay by canoe</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Book early; the good slots go quickly. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>98.55277,8.29167,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Market: crickets, silkworms, durian</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>98.38687,7.883,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Kata Beach in the evening</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>98.29805,7.81936,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Elephant sanctuary &amp; ethical animal care</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Choose places without riding and shows. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/phuket/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>98.38801,8.02216,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
